Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:03:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): status strip reads "1 Operation" for one operation

The status strip formatted the count as "{n} Operations", so one
operation read "1 Operations". It now uses the browser's existing
count helper: "1 Operation", "N Operations".

Pinned by the structural test
the_status_strip_counts_one_operation_in_the_singular_and_two_in_the_plural.

Fixes #2340

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
